{"4922730":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Send Them to Hell","steam_appid":4922730,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5129630],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demons Want Earth. Bad Idea.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan wants Earth. Unfortunately for him, you're ridiculously overpowered, the demons just keep coming, and you have a frankly unreasonable amount of firepower at your disposal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Send Them to Hell<\/strong> is a chaotic 2.5D action roguelite where you slaughter massive demon hordes, build increasingly ridiculous combinations of upgrades, and see just how far you can push your power before everything on screen explodes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or bring up to 3 friends along for the slaughter. Fight your way through hellish battlefields, discover powerful items, cast ultimate abilities, and turn yourself into a walking apocalypse.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Demons. Break Your Build. Beat Your Friends' Scores. Repeat.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/65c2f71f52aadda18810bb7a3c086028.avif?t=1793721098\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras_big\/65c2f71f52aadda18810bb7a3c086028.webp?t=1793721098 width=1560 height=875 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Your Way Through Multiple Game Modes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission in <strong>Adventure Mode<\/strong> is simple: survive five expanding biomes, grow stronger with every run, and take the fight straight to Satan himself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>But why stop there?<\/u><\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode<\/strong> - Battle through five biomes in a campaign that culminates in a showdown with Satan.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless<\/strong> - The hordes don't stop coming. How long can your build keep you alive?<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weekly Challenge<\/strong> - Take on a fresh challenge and compete for the highest score on the leaderboards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fractured Earth<\/strong> - Descend through a floor-based dungeon where every run offers another chance to fight deeper and push further.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/24168ef2569698a74e9a55f289c415ff.avif?t=1793721098\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras_big\/24168ef2569698a74e9a55f289c415ff.webp?t=1793721098 width=1560 height=877 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Friends. Cause Problems.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons are a lot less intimidating when four heavily armed lunatics are mowing them down together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 3 friends in online co-op and turn the battlefield into an absolute disaster for Satan's army. Work together, stack your upgrades, and see what happens when everyone's builds start getting out of hand.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can always compete for the high score afterward. Friendship is temporary. Leaderboards are forever.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/b5f5f986abaa908c44d2c71a46371123.poster.avif?t=1793721098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/b5f5f986abaa908c44d2c71a46371123.webm?t=1793721098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/b5f5f986abaa908c44d2c71a46371123.mp4?t=1793721098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Something Absurdly Powerful<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is another chance to discover a devastating combination of upgrades. With over <strong>100+ items<\/strong>, unlockable Legendary Items, powerful Tomes, and a full Perk Tree, there are plenty of ways to turn an ordinary demon hunter into an extinction-level crusader.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different upgrades. Unlock new abilities. Find combinations that make the hordes regret showing up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when a run ends? Take what you've earned, improve your character, and jump back into the slaughter even stronger than before.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/4290c397c194dec3157eeb62431ee66a.poster.avif?t=1793721098\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/4290c397c194dec3157eeb62431ee66a.webm?t=1793721098\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4922730\/extras\/4290c397c194dec3157eeb62431ee66a.mp4?t=1793721098\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earth Isn't Going to Defend Itself<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan made the first move. Now it's your turn. <strong>Send Them (back) to Hell.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Disclaimer:<\